116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 260 0 R
/E (Absence of True Sparsity in Routing: Standard softmax-based attention inherently passes noisy context between completely unrelated tokens. There is a lack of sequence routing mechanisms that can mathematically evaluate to exactly \(true sparsity\) when tokens share no context.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
117 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 261 0 R
/E (Euclidean Incompatibility with Hierarchy: Current embeddings use Euclidean spatial distance, which cannot natively enforce asymmetrical dependencies \(e.g., \). There is a gap in architectures representing language hierarchically via abstract algebra.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
