>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 262 0 R
/E (Current Large Language Models frequently hallucinate because they route sequential context using statistical probability and geometric proximity rather than strict logic. This project aims to design and train a novel "Soft L-Topological" neural architecture that embeds tokens as parameterized soft sets over a continuous lattice, utilizing differentiable lattice operators \(t-norms and t-conorms\) to compute exact logical intersections between tokens.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 263 0 R
/E (Scope: Custom embedding layer design, replacement of self-attention with -norm/-conorm routing, scaling from initial character-level testing to a benchmarked sub-word \(BPE\) language model.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
